# "Search your library for a land card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle." Any land card will do, not only a basic: Bot1 sacrifices its
# Forest (tapped for the {G} first) and fetches Tundra, which enters untapped, so Bot1 can tap it at once for {W}. The Forest is in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Crop Rotation
Plains x5
Tundra
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Crop Rotation.Cast
Bot1.Search(Tundra)
Bot1.Battlefield.Tundra.Activate(Ability: {W})
? Bot1.Mana = {W}

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Battlefield = Tundra
Bot1.Battlefield.Tundra.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Crop Rotation; Forest
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
